    {
      "id": "block-lesson-53-dialogue",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "我想去北京旅游。你去过吗？",
          "pinyin": "Wǒ xiǎng qù Běijīng lǚyóu. Nǐ qù guo ma?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Je voudrais aller voyager à Pékin. Tu y es déjà allé ?"
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-1ef9379d3b521139cf490112",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/1ef9379d3b521139cf490112.m4a",
            "sha256": "bc1c2326467e8658717016f04d193f94c44efb90fd8248ba4f8d7499cf259212",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3539
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "去过！那里的雪很大，很漂亮。",
          "pinyin": "Qù guo! Nàlǐ de xuě hěn dà, hěn piàoliang.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Oui ! Là-bas, il y a beaucoup de neige, c’est très joli."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-082d77a94ee346c7645d9562",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/082d77a94ee346c7645d9562.m4a",
            "sha256": "92c5d68300be9ecb881d8dc2f5fa79778dac1d4c24581347741301a9093bcf09",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3305
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "是吗？我想看雪！我买票了，明天下午三点的。",
          "pinyin": "Shì ma? Wǒ xiǎng kàn xuě! Wǒ mǎi piào le, míngtiān xiàwǔ sān diǎn de.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Vraiment ? Je veux voir la neige ! J’ai acheté mon billet, pour demain à trois heures de l’après-midi."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-820debfae2eb02be02f48fd0",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/820debfae2eb02be02f48fd0.m4a",
            "sha256": "f15d2ab7eb736b8ddc2f52fd7e53bc62d25f26deaa0300b4b3cc90c7d958c57d",
            "durationMilliseconds": 5916
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "等一下，你看，这是今天的票。你买错了！",
          "pinyin": "Děng yíxià, nǐ kàn, zhè shì jīntiān de piào. Nǐ mǎi cuò le!",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Attends, regarde : ce billet est pour aujourd’hui. Tu t’es trompée !"
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-dfbc597c8f208f2544e89c54",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/dfbc597c8f208f2544e89c54.m4a",
            "sha256": "e77f8536dc967a67ec866dcf4c696cef8d296719316947fe115b3166d92b7308",
            "durationMilliseconds": 4217
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "我看看。是错了！因为我很高兴，所以看错了。",
          "pinyin": "Wǒ kànkan. Shì cuò le! Yīnwèi wǒ hěn gāoxìng, suǒyǐ kàn cuò le.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Laisse-moi voir. C’est vrai, il y a une erreur ! J’étais si contente que j’ai mal lu."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-f4f5f156fbd43c165c6ae20e",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/f4f5f156fbd43c165c6ae20e.m4a",
            "sha256": "816070885cc6a9992ffdc8a0662617d33188a6a2c7b9c005f3c6627c2d33a096",
            "durationMilliseconds": 6058
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "没关系！我们现在去机场，再买一张票。",
          "pinyin": "Méi guānxì! Wǒmen xiànzài qù jīchǎng, zài mǎi yì zhāng piào.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Ce n’est pas grave ! Allons tout de suite à l’aéroport racheter un billet."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-6802ce79d89526ee8fe0cf20",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/6802ce79d89526ee8fe0cf20.m4a",
            "sha256": "7dab3567213e93268071f414d1c5421168a9870f4f263ac7630cdfbb7ba2e9a6",
            "durationMilliseconds": 4359
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "好！你和我一起去旅游吧。",
          "pinyin": "Hǎo! Nǐ hé wǒ yìqǐ qù lǚyóu ba.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "D’accord ! Viens voyager avec moi."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-6e8426c84bde64484047b508",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/6e8426c84bde64484047b508.m4a",
            "sha256": "6a542d9a06406535834e4669bf4c8a3678cfe81e539a6a3d80570b89a14f1951",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3067
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "我不能去，明天我要工作。但是我送你去机场。",
          "pinyin": "Wǒ bù néng qù, míngtiān wǒ yào gōngzuò. Dànshì wǒ sòng nǐ qù jīchǎng.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Je ne peux pas, demain je dois travailler. Mais je t’accompagne à l’aéroport."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-30af4c55a3034c109af046c4",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/30af4c55a3034c109af046c4.m4a",
            "sha256": "f15a6174f59018924da605756059b4a4576d9b6449ecd2513e26484ca6b71373",
            "durationMilliseconds": 4667
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "谢谢你！北京很冷，我要买衣服。",
          "pinyin": "Xièxie nǐ! Běijīng hěn lěng, wǒ yào mǎi yīfu.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Merci ! Il fait très froid à Pékin, je dois acheter des vêtements."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-83f47b09197fcf46e99f2627",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/83f47b09197fcf46e99f2627.m4a",
            "sha256": "07191e937ec3783da222970a6a423e41bc2fc850f1688881ac5b5eb9f4e3a6c8",
            "durationMilliseconds": 4145
          }
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "是，那里有雪，你要多买些衣服。",
          "pinyin": "Shì, nàlǐ yǒu xuě, nǐ yào duō mǎi xiē yīfu.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Oui, il y a de la neige là-bas, prends bien des vêtements chauds."
          },
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-677c4a7007441fd94ca801ff",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/677c4a7007441fd94ca801ff.m4a",
            "sha256": "9e9d9ca59f69b6c7d5945ab8021839521ffe670bad7f529603eec33f639dcaa7",
            "durationMilliseconds": 3118
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "metadata": {
        "stage": "understand",
        "skill": "listening",
        "lessonDay": 49
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block-lesson-53-reading",
      "storyID": "story-lesson-53",
      "level": "HSK classique 2",
      "title": {
        "fr": "Un mot pour la classe"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "lesson-53-p1",
          "hanzi": "老师，你好！因为我要去北京旅游，所以明天我不能去学校。",
          "pinyin": "Lǎoshī, nǐ hǎo! Yīnwèi wǒ yào qù Běijīng lǚyóu, suǒyǐ míngtiān wǒ bù néng qù xuéxiào.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Bonjour, professeur ! Comme je vais voyager à Pékin, je ne pourrai pas aller à l’école demain."
          },
          "segmentation": [],
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-43c3a23e4fd4eb3633fe1e3b",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/43c3a23e4fd4eb3633fe1e3b.m4a",
            "sha256": "81295289b76f3ee174bea219d4e20640c858d2122cfc0be11bf018e50177b116",
            "durationMilliseconds": 6196
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "lesson-53-p2",
          "hanzi": "那里有雪，我很想看。我坐下午的飞机，票很便宜。星期五我就回来。",
          "pinyin": "Nàlǐ yǒu xuě, wǒ hěn xiǎng kàn. Wǒ zuò xiàwǔ de fēijī, piào hěn piányi. Xīngqīwǔ wǒ jiù huílái.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Il y a de la neige là-bas, j’ai très envie de la voir. Je prends l’avion de l’après-midi, le billet n’est pas cher. Je serai de retour vendredi."
          },
          "segmentation": [],
          "audio": {
            "id": "audio-004e23baf95bee5fd3553911",
            "kind": "audio",
            "relativePath": "assets/audio/004e23baf95bee5fd3553911.m4a",
            "sha256": "c0627ff0451647c62c8506ccc9afd2c45a1d370c206b78adc34ec991b4f7ea93",
            "durationMilliseconds": 8103
          }
        }
      ],
      "comprehensionExerciseIDs": [
        "ex-l53-reading"
      ],
      "kind": "reading",
